# Weekly Executive Summary
body[1]{content}:
  "Sprint 4.10 marks the conclusion of our foundational scaling phase. By parallelizing our development and data engines, we have built a resilient system capable of delivering specialized equipment dialects faster and more reliably. We are now ready for Phase 5: empowering the independent designer with procedural geometry."

# Sharded Deep-Dives
spokes[1]{title, audience, summary}:
  Engineering for Infinite Scale, Developers, "Deep-dive into the hybrid Rayon/Actor WASM engine and CI sharding."

# Sprint 5.1 Staging
next_sprint[1]{objective, tiers, status}:
  IKD Enablement (Geometry & Tuning), 20, Proposed
